# 统一行尾策略：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows 贡献者因 core.autocrlf 配置差异
# 产生全文件 diff。二进制文件明确标记防止被文本化破坏。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专属脚本保持 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.apk binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.zip binary
*.jar binary
*.so binary
